    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d34">

                <pb facs="0148" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg42"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November 4,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Conger reports that, owing to fear of plots for the restoration of the
                    monarchy, the President had on this date by decrees dissolved Congress and
                    declared martial law.</p>
            </div>
